  unitName: Almighty Imp Arton
  unitId: 50612
  unitNumber: 814
  description: An imp who guided others of his kind during the creation of the heavens
    and the earth. Said to have been born from the combination of dozens of imps,
    Arton supervised his subordinates while they worked. Not only is he extremely
    wise, but as the almighty imp, it is speculated that he could be used as an all-purpose
    ingredient instead of fusing numerous other imps at once. However, capturing
    Arton is an extremely rare feat, and thus research on this subject has failed
    to advance any further.
  summonDesc: It seems you're still incomplete.<br>I shall help you reach perfection.<br>Come
    on, don't be shy now!
